{
  "about": "The kit's two Stream Deck + layouts (plan section 4; Studio Mode since K.6). 'fadester' is a preset in the shape of profiles/layouts.json, checked by validatePreset and built by buildProfile (scripts/profile-checks.ts); 'vjster' is a layout in the shape of scripts/vjster/build-profiles.ts, built by its profileFiles. Every binding is a fixed name or UUID from kit-ids.json: Playlister keys by inputUuid, filter controls by sourceUuid + filterName + filterKind (versioned_id), layer keys by scene name + item id with the source's uuid, scene keys by __scene_index_N__ (every one sets Preview; the scene mixer on dial 1 of every page blends Preview into Program, a press takes Next live), the beat fader by inputName. Captions are shipped defaults (drawn translated) or exact OBS names (plan section 15 item 1). scripts/build-kit-profiles.ts checks this file against kit-ids.json and writes demo-kit/build/profiles/.",
